!workspace/workspaces/
!workspace/skills/
workspace/workspaces/*/daily-report-*.md
workspace/workspaces/*/audit-log-*.md
workspace/workspaces/*/research-*.md

# Agent-generated scratch in per-agent workspaces — keep only identity files
